  "reasoning": "The defendant fabricated a false procuratorial document, altered its content, changed dates, and copied the official seal of the People's Procuratorate onto the forged document. This constitutes forging and altering a state organ's official document and seal, which matches the statutory offense of falsifying, altering, or dealing in state organ documents, certificates, or seals. No other crimes such as bribery or fraud are indicated beyond the forgery itself.",
